  "limitations": [
    "This is a design path from real model anchors, not yet a runtime collision or acceptance pass.",
    "The lower pipe route is visually real but narrow; gameplay should use surface decals, hover gates and matching simplified collision proxy rather than raw mesh collision.",
    "Route overlays should be ground-projected decals on traversable surfaces and vertical gates during deliberate air gaps; avoid continuous floating debug splines in close-up gameplay views.",
    "The full level remains visual context; the first playable route still needs simplified resident collision and authored mission markers.",
    "Offline Blender images are design evidence; browser playtest evidence is still required.",
    "The old Bridgehead v2 path was not used as the design target for this pass."
